  m_Name: Market Advertisement
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Market Advertisement
  content: 'Amberwood Market Fair


    Every Seventh Day

    Fresh produce from
    Springtide!

    Precision tools from the Foundry!

    Rare books from Frostmere!

    Local
    crafts, music, and warm meals throughout the day.


    Children under twelve
    may enter the pie-eating contest free of charge.'
